I think he's aggressive.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.740
Aggressive with the chopsticks.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.840
He's about to break all the plates and glasses he finds.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:16.940
I didn't tell you.

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:20.320
Call me at the goal. See you later.

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:21.510
See you later.

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:25.770
