00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:36.770
- Come in. - Oh, it was you.

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:38.370
- What time is it? - 11:30.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:41.970
- I didn't tell you to call me. - I did, but you threw a shoe at my head.

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:43.970
- You would have insisted. - I did, sir.

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:46.570
- And? - You insisted and gave me an eye.

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:47.970
Sorry.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:49.660
- Has the time come? - Not yet.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:53.430
- And the shameless Rivero? - Nothing more than a source of rice and milk.

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:55.760
Two cards, an infinity of cards. Let's see.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.760
A letter from my cousin Pablo. What will he say?

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:09.900
Dear Albert, I have to ask you a favor that matters.

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:14.020
Since I know you're not a great dawner, which is bad,

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:18.020
because time is gold, I will wake you up at 12 o'clock.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:20.180
Wait for me. Your cousin Pablo.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:22.010
Come here, I'm sure he'll ask me.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.010
Since he's about to get married, he might...

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.020
You're right. Or maybe he'll want to go out as a witness.

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:30.000
How lucky to marry such an angelic, so sincere girl.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.250
- And with a lot of money. - I think so.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.390
- A wedding like this would sell me well. - If you didn't mediate Ms. Laura.

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:38.070
I'm not even mediate. Don't think I'm unfriendly.

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.840
In fact, I've noticed that I'm extremely nice to you.

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:43.350
But anyway, let's continue with the correspondence.

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:48.720
Dear Alberto, I have to speak urgently with you.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:52.560
I will take the liberty of visiting you from 12 to 12:15...

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.030
...the hour I think you will be able to receive me.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:55.990
With honor.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:59.410
The mother of the girl in my house! I'm going to get ready.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:07.030
And if he comes first, tell him I'm not here, that I went to China, to Europe...

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:09.930
- To the flotas? Who's rowing here? - I don't know.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:13.670
Long live love!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.610
- My teeth hurt. - We have to get this guy out of here!

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:19.450
- Before Mrs. Leonor arrives! - Wine, more wine!

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:22.190
- Water, water! - Long live the great Jerez!

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:25.050
Long live the giant Champagne! It's raining!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.290
It's raining, but it's pouring!

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:30.000
What the hell is going on?

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:33.110
- What's the matter? - The night in wine, the morning in water?

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.010
Yes, sir.

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:37.070
This pours a liquid in favor of the singer of the 20th century.

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.070
But do you think I'm going to continue celebrating my saint?

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:43.070
Sure, last night it was nothing more than a simple brushstroke.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:45.070
Stop brushing, I want to be alone, do you understand?

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:48.080
- Leave me a friend? - But you are not my friend.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:52.080
Five years ago I repeated the same thing, however you can't be far from me.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:57.080
- Rivero, I hate you. - Magnetic, with hate eternal friendships are made.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:14:00.000
- Rivero, I have no time to lose. - What, you kick me?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.760
- Okay, I'll go. But it won't be without... - Without what?

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.820
- Without you having breakfast. - There's no milk.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:10.900
Well, come to the corner and give me half and half.

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:12.860
- Do you give me the money? - The money?

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:17.010
Oh, yes. Here, take Alberto's pocket money, 10 pesos.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.310
Give me a good tip and you keep the change.

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:21.910
- Okay, prepare the coffee with milk. - They're going to catch me.

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:23.710
When I got up, I found the milkman.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.640
- Rivero, you're a octopus. - What did you say?

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:28.840
Yes, an octopus that keeps me between its tentacles and I can't get out of it.

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.000
That's it!

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:33.230
There are comparisons that no matter how maritime they are, they offend.

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:36.190
I, the prey of your fame.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:39.140
The ladder through which you climb the pinnacle.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.090
I have blinded women with your talent.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:45.110
They all talk about the painter who sings.

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.000
And you see the result.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:50.140
There were days that the door of your house looked like a movie theater.

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:52.140
Tail up to the corner.

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:54.120
Now yes, it was a female tail.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.120
A tail that unites.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.230
But without pricking.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:00.000
Who will be the form?

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:02.730
- Hello. - Someone who loves me a lot.

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:04.930
- Yes. - Good afternoon, ma'am.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:09.740
I can't forgive you. You introduced me to Laura.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:10.960
And you reproach me?

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:13.400
Laura is a good girl who loves you with delirium.

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:14.450
And you too, that...

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:16.910
What do I know about this bohemian life without rest?

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:20.510
Bad, bad. You are feeling the nostalgia of marriage.

00:15:20.510 --> 00:15:21.870
And even if I felt it, what?

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.710
Do you think I would marry a loner like you?

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.000
Marry you?

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:27.570
But that's where men come down.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.000
- Miss Laura. - How are you?

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:33.450
- Can I say hello to the Lord of the Saints? - Laurita!

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:36.550
- Good morning, Rivero. - You arrived just in time.

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:39.690
- I'll have a little. - A little? A cup? We have plenty.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:42.650
What about you? Don't you realize we have a guest today?

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:45.470
- Right away. - Alberto, I remember.

00:15:45.550 --> 00:15:48.110
- But why did you bother? - May I, sir?

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:50.690
- Have you had many gifts? - Yes, until now, the ones you see there.

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:53.030
There's also a box of American cigarettes.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:55.890
And you hadn't told me anything about the natado.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.990
But, Rivero, even the vices are to be kept.

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:00.000
What's your name?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:06.220
A total of two drafts, smoke that spreads, ash that spreads...

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:08.220
And a cigarette that you smoke!

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:10.210
But have you never thought of changing your life?

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:12.270
Haven't you ever felt the urge to work?

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:15.100
Sometimes I feel it, but I can't stand it.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:18.920
I have an iron will, what is called a character.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:22.100
Well, then, what happens? We'll all have lunch together, right?

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:24.100
Impossible! Today I'm leaving on a trip.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.970
Ah, it's true. I had forgotten the mystery of your life.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:30.000
The time has come for Buenos Aires to disappear every year.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.820
Mystery? Well, mystery is true for all of us.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:36.730
It wouldn't be for you if you didn't fear indiscretion...

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:39.490
...in a moment like that in which champagne runs.

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:42.070
And this one has a heavier wine.

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:44.280
But that mystery will soon stop being one.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:46.520
And then we'll talk, Mr. Painter.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.790
- About what? - What it's supposed to be.

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.620
About what you've promised me so many times.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.220
Oh, come on!

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:56.440
In such a way that Fred needs innocence, huh?

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:59.860
That they will seem to me three centuries away from Alberto.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.610
Especially knowing that she's staying with you.

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:04.180
To hell with you!

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:06.640
No, for God's sake, this time I assure you that I'm going to be alone.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.660
Well, do you want to come with me?

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.100
I have to do some errands.

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.480
Then we can go for a ride until the train's time.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:15.120
In the second, I agree. In the first, it's impossible for me.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:17.440
I'm waiting for my cousin Pablo, who's about to get married.

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:19.440
And by the way, time flies and I'm going to change, eh?

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:22.590
Come on, and by the way, bring me a pack of cigarettes.

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:23.790
Ah, and phosphorus.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.850
If I knew you were dying smoking them all, I'd give you the box.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:27.770
Do the test.

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:29.540
I've noticed that they hurt me.

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:30.000
said

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:33.710
Your brother will never die!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:38.030
Laurita, why didn't you reveal to me that secret?

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.030
To you?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.030
You think I can't keep a secret?

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:43.400
Until you get drunk.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:47.360
The last time we had dinner at the pub, you drank a bottle of Curaçao.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:50.380
And he told you you were married.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:51.360
I was married?

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.180
Oh, yes.

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:54.100
It must have been the priest.

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:55.100
What?

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:58.100
The priest who awoke in me marriage ideas.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:59.060
Don't lie to me.

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:00.000
Poor woman.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.000
I don't want to be the husband's wife.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:05.690
We wouldn't throw the dishes at each other's heads.

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:13.040
Hey, crazy, what are you doing?

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:16.240
Get crazy and tell me the cause of your mysterious disappearance.

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:19.330
Don't worry, I'll tell Alberto about it.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.530
And that's because lately he's been cold with me.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.680
It's your imagination.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:26.790
And do you think he'll keep his word about marrying me?

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:30.000
I think you should remind him every quarter of an hour, because maybe he'll come today.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.000
and takes him away.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.000
What are you saying?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.490
Marry another woman?

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:34.890
Do you know something?

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:36.390
Calm down, woman, calm down.

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:37.800
It's a hypothesis.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.970
A hypothesis that has occurred to me.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.610
Besides, if Alberto left you...

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:44.110
Here, you have my letter.

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:45.110
Don't say nonsense.

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:47.110
Alberto will marry me, do you hear?

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:48.950
It's mine.

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.350
- -

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:53.370
- -

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:55.370
- -

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:59.350
- -

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:04.590
THE LADY OF THE HOUSE

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.250
Come in. The gentleman is waiting for you.

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:23.460
Thank you very much.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.250
- Good morning. - Good morning.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:29.480
- I have the pleasure of talking to the master of the house. - Even more.

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:34.200
I understand, the lady is the mistress of the master of the house.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:37.160
Are you the perfidious in the form of a visitor?

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.800
I'm Pablo Basavilbaso,

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:42.300
professor in exact sciences and cousin of Alberto.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:43.980
Ah, you're the one who's getting married?

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:45.800
Ah, but he told you that...

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:47.180
He has no secrets to me.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.500
Go with Don Pablo.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.270
With what, deimeneo, huh?

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:54.620
Yes, deimeneo.

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:56.260
What, do you think you're wrong?

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:58.820
Are you the enemy of marriage?

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.000
Marriage?

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:05.390
And since I'm talking to a math teacher, I'm going to allow myself a certain theme.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:09.330
Marriage, my dear Mr. Pablo, is an unknown.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.610
Huh?

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:15.180
Once a woman is married, it's a number that can't be divided by two.

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:17.570
Unless the husband is a cousin.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.170
It can also be that the husband is unbreakable.

00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:21.030
But what are you saying?

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:26.760
In which case, that number that represents the woman becomes what is called in grammar, common of two.

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:27.980
Now, problem.

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:29.470
I'll solve it.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:30.000
The husband...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:34.920
Since it is a whole number, when you hear certain comparisons...

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.920
...you must extract the root of who makes them...

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:41.920
...or in the last of the cases, raise it to the cube and drop it.

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.810
But, Ribero...

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.860
Oh, my dear teacher...

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:50.860
...didn't you think that a slight numerical metaphor could erase your noxious feelings?

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:53.870
It's just that by getting into everything, you get even into mathematics.

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:55.870
What are you saying, dear Pablo?

00:20:55.870 --> 00:21:00.000
My best model is Mrs. Laura, my cousin Pablo.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:04.360
- Pocho Rivero. - The Fat Totum or almost Totum of this house?

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:07.660
Well, I'm leaving. While you talk to your cousin, I'm going to do some shopping.

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:09.760
- Okay, but take Rivero, huh? - Enough.

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:12.290
A wish of yours is an order for me. I'll go with you.

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:16.820
- Nice to meet you, young man. - At your feet.

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:19.840
- Did you bring the cigarettes? - Yes, take them.

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:22.270
- Let's go, my dear. - Let's go, Pocho.

00:21:22.370 --> 00:21:25.030
Yes, my dear, let's go. Come with Pochito.

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:29.160
Give me the matches, okay?

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:33.570
What a beautiful figurine, that one of Pablo.

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:35.970
What a tough man, it looks like an encyclopedia.

00:21:35.970 --> 00:21:38.130
So you can learn to value the good.

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:39.730
That's why I value Alberto.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:42.580
It's obvious that I can't get rid of him, but I don't care.

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:45.360
Hope is the last thing you lose.

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:50.540
This is a true relic.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:53.640
There are only two, and I'm looking for the couple.

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:56.560
Maybe you can help me get the other one.

00:21:56.560 --> 00:22:00.000
Well, I'm going to introduce you to a collector friend, but I guess...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:03.320
- You'll have to talk about your next... - Wedding, you guessed it.

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:06.680
- You're marrying an incomparable girl. - You want me to marry her?

00:22:07.270 --> 00:22:09.920
- That wedding is almost cancelled. - Don't say that.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:13.120
Since my girlfriend and her mother are in Buenos Aires,

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:15.400
I've taken them everywhere.

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:20.010
Art conferences, museums, a session at the congress.

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:22.850
I've even made them attend an embalming.

00:22:22.930 --> 00:22:26.220
- Yes, the most fun thing in Buenos Aires. - That's what I thought.

00:22:26.300 --> 00:22:30.000
But precisely yesterday, the two of them, the mother and the daughter...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.200
They complained that they were very bored.

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.440
Look, Pablo, I told you...

00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:34.440
You don't say anything.

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:35.940
I'm the one who says here.

00:22:35.940 --> 00:22:37.740
Better said, the one I told them

00:22:37.740 --> 00:22:40.440
that if they wanted me to take them to the zoo,

00:22:40.440 --> 00:22:44.300
and they answered me that if I gave them my word to stay there,

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:45.640
they had no problem.

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:47.860
Why are you laughing?

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:48.800
Sorry, Pablo.

00:22:48.800 --> 00:22:50.240
Well, you already know me.

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:51.900
The truth is that I got carried away,

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:54.500
my future mother-in-law also got carried away,

00:22:54.500 --> 00:22:56.040
and my girlfriend went away.

00:22:56.040 --> 00:22:57.440
You made me amazed.

00:22:57.440 --> 00:22:59.510
I didn't want to hear it again.

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:00.000
Yes.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:04.000
But of course, I've thought about it better and I don't want to be like that.

00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:08.250
The girl is rich and you have to settle the matter.

00:23:08.350 --> 00:23:10.250
Me? And how?

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:13.950
They appreciate you a lot. They are delighted with your treatment.

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:19.730
You have all the bad qualities that women like and they have a lot of sympathy for you.

00:23:19.880 --> 00:23:22.630
Me? Well, I'll defend your cause.

00:23:22.730 --> 00:23:24.630
- With warmth? - And passion!

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:30.000
Then I'm saved. With a lawyer like you, there will be no condemnation sentence.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:34.000
I knew you were the only one who could fix this for me.

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:47.700
You've returned my peace of mind.

00:23:47.700 --> 00:23:49.650
- I'll do everything I can. - Excuse me?

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:52.650
- What is it? - Mrs. Leonora and Mrs. Beatriz want to see you.

00:23:52.650 --> 00:23:55.650
- Let them in. - I forgot they announced their visit.

00:23:55.650 --> 00:23:57.570
- What am I supposed to do? - Get in the car.

00:23:57.570 --> 00:24:00.000
- What are you doing? - I don't know.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.040
And wait for me. Here?

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:03.040
Yes, yes, yes.

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:10.150
- Good morning, friend Albert. - Come in, they're in your house.

00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:12.150
- Thank you very much. - Roque, do you have something to drink?

00:24:12.190 --> 00:24:15.150
We came to say goodbye because we returned to Villa Tranquila.

00:24:15.190 --> 00:24:18.150
- But so soon? - My mother feels the nostalgia of your house.

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:21.160
And she feels it for not having found any attractions or distractions here.

00:24:21.200 --> 00:24:24.160
But don't go. I wanted to think of taking you for a walk.

00:24:24.200 --> 00:24:26.160
- Really? - But what a kindness!

00:24:26.200 --> 00:24:30.000
I'm sure you don't know anything about Buenos Aires, about Buenos Aires.

00:24:30.440 --> 00:24:32.940
We know the Buenos Aires of Bostezas.

00:24:32.940 --> 00:24:35.940
Anyway, if you want to stay, I'll take care of taking her.

00:24:35.940 --> 00:24:37.440
Oh, yes, Mom.

00:24:37.440 --> 00:24:42.080
When I think that a pretty girl like you is going to bury herself again in the back of a province,

00:24:42.080 --> 00:24:45.080
you, who by your elegance would be an ideal bodyguard...

00:24:45.080 --> 00:24:47.080
What a good talker.

00:24:47.080 --> 00:24:49.080
What a distinction.

00:24:49.080 --> 00:24:50.590
My cousin told me everything about yesterday.

00:24:50.590 --> 00:24:55.090
I feel in my soul that I have relatives with you, but you have behaved like a cartman.

00:24:55.090 --> 00:24:57.590
Like a cartman in all the extension of the vehicle.

00:24:57.590 --> 00:25:00.000
- What? - But you have your excuses.

00:25:01.240 --> 00:25:03.620
My cousin has devoted his time to science.

00:25:03.620 --> 00:25:05.620
This made him neglect his education,

00:25:05.620 --> 00:25:08.650
which, for that reason, leaves much to be desired.

00:25:08.650 --> 00:25:10.110
But he's drowning me.

00:25:10.110 --> 00:25:13.110
When he overflows, he becomes inopportune, rude.

00:25:13.110 --> 00:25:16.410
You are making an inimitable portrait.

00:25:16.410 --> 00:25:18.990
The guilt of yesterday is exclusively yours.

00:25:18.990 --> 00:25:21.210
Now, does that guilt deserve forgiveness?

00:25:21.210 --> 00:25:23.010
In my opinion, no.

00:25:23.010 --> 00:25:24.550
I never liked Pablo.

00:25:24.550 --> 00:25:27.110
It was all because I didn't like you.

00:25:27.110 --> 00:25:29.640
Stay calm, it's a plan.

00:25:32.400 --> 00:25:34.400
Are you going to say that it's my fault? No, it's not.

00:25:34.400 --> 00:25:38.690
Well, don't argue now. The important thing is that my cousin doesn't deserve Beatriz.

00:25:38.690 --> 00:25:42.750
How are you going to sacrifice her beauty, her joy, to unite her with him?

00:25:42.750 --> 00:25:46.780
Excuse me.

00:25:46.780 --> 00:25:49.470
- Hello? - How are you? How's that going?

00:25:49.470 --> 00:25:53.520
- Have you already entered the real territory of my defense? - Yes, man, yes.

00:25:53.520 --> 00:25:57.950
- And? Do you understand each other? - We're going to understand each other very soon.

00:25:57.950 --> 00:26:00.000
- Are you convinced? - Completely.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:02.060
Now, more than ever, I'm renouncing this marriage.

00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:03.440
Thank you, Mom.

00:26:03.440 --> 00:26:06.120
I'm so sorry. Poor Pablo.

00:26:06.120 --> 00:26:09.280
The only thing to be sorry about is that all of Villatranquila knows that Beatriz

00:26:09.280 --> 00:26:11.200
wanted to take care of us.

00:26:11.200 --> 00:26:14.140
Now everyone will comment on the rupture to their liking.

00:26:14.140 --> 00:26:18.310
Beatriz, she needs a man who, without being a child, is still young.

00:26:18.310 --> 00:26:20.390
That's right, sir.

00:26:20.390 --> 00:26:22.570
Happy, without exaggeration.

00:26:22.570 --> 00:26:24.300
- That she has run a little. - Eh?

00:26:24.300 --> 00:26:27.890
- Not much. - Ah, so that she can find a more loving life at home.

00:26:27.890 --> 00:26:29.110
That's right, that's right.

00:26:29.110 --> 00:26:30.000
- Yes. - Finally.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:32.600
- A man like... - Like?

00:26:32.700 --> 00:26:34.110
- And like... - Like?

00:26:34.210 --> 00:26:37.020
Girls, look at the paintings out there.

00:26:37.280 --> 00:26:39.470
I have to talk to Alberto.

00:26:39.570 --> 00:26:40.560
Yes, mom.

00:26:41.330 --> 00:26:42.850
- Mom? - Son.

00:26:43.370 --> 00:26:46.290
My friend Alberto, if I haven't heard wrong,

00:26:46.410 --> 00:26:48.310
and for a mother, at certain moments,

00:26:48.450 --> 00:26:50.630
a slight murmur is a big blow,

00:26:50.840 --> 00:26:53.190
that man you just described is you.

00:26:53.290 --> 00:26:54.990
Yes, that's one thing.

00:26:55.090 --> 00:26:57.090
Maybe it's too bold a question,

00:26:57.480 --> 00:27:00.000
but would you mind being my son-in-law?

00:27:00.030 --> 00:27:03.270
- Ma'am! - No, no, if you don't like my little girl, I haven't said anything.

00:27:03.290 --> 00:27:04.530
What if I don't like her?

00:27:04.550 --> 00:27:08.580
I'm going crazy! You've wanted her since the first moment you saw Beatriz.

00:27:08.600 --> 00:27:10.360
But what if I don't like her?

00:27:10.380 --> 00:27:12.380
Oh, I do like her!

00:27:12.400 --> 00:27:13.300
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:27:13.320 --> 00:27:15.940
- Really, would you marry me? - Right away.

00:27:15.960 --> 00:27:17.800
Right, Mom? Can we get married right away?

00:27:17.820 --> 00:27:19.980
- I already have the wedding dress. - Yes, the dress is here.

00:27:20.000 --> 00:27:22.500
Well, then tonight, to celebrate, I invite you to the theater.

00:27:22.520 --> 00:27:24.620
- Yes, Mom, yes. - We'll wait for you at the hotel.

00:27:24.640 --> 00:27:26.720
- At nine o'clock. - But not yesterday!

00:27:26.740 --> 00:27:28.410
Dear Mom...

00:27:28.430 --> 00:27:30.000
You can kiss her.

00:27:30.320 --> 00:27:33.930
No, no, no. It's in the hand.

00:27:33.930 --> 00:27:35.780
Hey, I said one.

00:27:35.780 --> 00:27:36.780
Sorry, ma'am.

00:27:36.780 --> 00:27:39.780
I've already seen that he put the zero behind the one.

00:27:39.780 --> 00:27:41.780
See you later, Alvaro.

00:27:41.780 --> 00:27:43.780
See you later, see you later.

00:27:43.780 --> 00:27:45.780
You have to dress a lot.

00:27:45.780 --> 00:27:47.780
See you later, see you later.

00:27:52.400 --> 00:27:56.900
Mine, mine, who's going to tell me? Mine!

00:27:56.900 --> 00:28:00.000
Mine!

00:28:00.280 --> 00:28:02.280
And now, what was I going to tell Pablo?

00:28:02.280 --> 00:28:04.280
It's true, with joy he didn't remember me.

00:28:07.810 --> 00:28:09.780
- Did you win? - I did.

00:28:09.780 --> 00:28:11.820
- And why aren't you here? - Because I can't see you.

00:28:11.820 --> 00:28:14.820
- How? - Ah, but my triumph has been definitive.

00:28:14.820 --> 00:28:17.820
I expected it. You are less clumsy than you seem.

00:28:17.820 --> 00:28:20.320
- I'm running to the hotel. - No, no, no, don't go.

00:28:20.320 --> 00:28:22.320
Are you crazy? With what you've done,

00:28:22.320 --> 00:28:24.320
plus a little plea from me,

00:28:24.320 --> 00:28:26.320
the matter is over, you'll see.

00:28:30.280 --> 00:28:32.280
- Pay the car, I'm not changing. - Okay.

00:28:33.800 --> 00:28:36.300
- Sorry. - This mathematician must be a bit crazy.

00:28:36.600 --> 00:28:38.300
- I'll wait for you upstairs, Laurita. - Yes.

00:28:46.420 --> 00:28:49.420
Now you have me back here, ready to celebrate with a lunch,

00:28:49.620 --> 00:28:50.820
the saint of a friend.

00:28:51.020 --> 00:28:54.320
No lunch, no women and no Calaveras friends.

00:28:54.520 --> 00:28:55.920
Yes, what does this mean?

00:28:56.320 --> 00:28:58.470
Oh, what a terrible suspicion.

00:28:58.660 --> 00:29:00.000
Alberto, you're Calaveras.

00:29:00.160 --> 00:29:02.160
Yes, I'll marry you and you'll leave, do you understand?

00:29:02.160 --> 00:29:03.160
I don't want to see you anymore!

00:29:03.160 --> 00:29:06.240
Well, Laura is on her way, she left paying for the taxi, what will you tell her?

00:29:06.240 --> 00:29:10.240
Nothing, she'll go away for three months and when she comes back, the marriage will be in her hands.

00:29:10.240 --> 00:29:13.240
- Then... - Look, if it weren't for this fraternal affection that I have for you,

00:29:13.240 --> 00:29:16.240
- I would tell Laura right now... - And you think you're going to scare me?

00:29:16.240 --> 00:29:18.240
Come on, tell her, come on!

00:29:18.240 --> 00:29:21.180
You're challenging me because you know I'm incapable of such a thing.

00:29:21.180 --> 00:29:22.230
Miss Laura...

00:29:22.230 --> 00:29:27.650
Well, I've done all the paperwork, will you come with me to the station?

00:29:27.650 --> 00:29:30.000
- Yes, but alone, I know. - Of course alone!

00:29:30.250 --> 00:29:32.950
He'll have time to take you in his arms.

00:29:32.950 --> 00:29:37.240
No, I also have to leave Buenos Aires, even if it's just for a couple of days.

00:29:37.240 --> 00:29:39.770
What a pity that you didn't leave for three months.

00:29:39.770 --> 00:29:42.740
- Well, I'm going to get ready a little before leaving. - I'll wait for you.

00:29:42.740 --> 00:29:44.590
- Where is that bastard? - He went to Portugal.

00:29:44.590 --> 00:29:46.390
- Let me go. - I said he went to Portugal to get an inheritance.

00:29:46.390 --> 00:29:48.300
I don't care, I'll wait for him anyway.

00:29:50.040 --> 00:29:53.730
Sir, you're the last of the miserable.

00:29:53.730 --> 00:29:55.940
- Dear cousin... - You don't call me cousin.

00:29:55.940 --> 00:29:57.140
Cousin has been before.

00:29:57.140 --> 00:30:00.000
- Since now the relationship is over. - Well, so what?

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:03.600
He stole that woman from me the eve of my marriage.

00:30:03.600 --> 00:30:06.500
Well, it's better if it's the eve and not the next day.

00:30:06.500 --> 00:30:09.200
But who gives you what you don't care about?

00:30:09.200 --> 00:30:11.500
- I'll tell you. - To hell with you, bitch!

00:30:11.500 --> 00:30:13.360
This has been a villainy!

00:30:13.360 --> 00:30:17.270
Look, coward! Look what I do to your fibula and all this crap!

00:30:30.800 --> 00:30:32.810
I'll tell the kid to kick the rice!

00:30:32.810 --> 00:30:34.810
Oh, kick it, you know!

00:30:34.810 --> 00:30:45.950
Oh, but...

00:30:45.950 --> 00:30:47.950
No, no, no!

00:30:47.950 --> 00:30:49.950
The rice is not for him, it's innocent!

00:30:49.950 --> 00:30:51.950
No, no, no!

00:31:03.480 --> 00:31:07.020
I'll avenge myself, I'll tell that Laura who was here before.

00:31:07.020 --> 00:31:08.980
- Speak softly, I can hear you. - Where is she?

00:31:08.980 --> 00:31:11.980
- In there, I'll tell you everything if you want. - Of course I'll tell you!

00:31:17.730 --> 00:31:19.910
I'm Chivo in the Laza.

00:31:19.910 --> 00:31:22.460
These grannies have been watching me!

00:31:25.210 --> 00:31:27.200
Open! Open!

00:31:27.200 --> 00:31:30.000
All right, open it or I'll set the house on fire!

00:31:31.660 --> 00:31:34.660
- What's going on? What are those screams? - Nothing, it's the...

00:31:34.660 --> 00:31:37.860
The madman we had to lock him up.

00:31:37.860 --> 00:31:39.860
That's how Rivero pays for his ungratefulness.

00:31:39.860 --> 00:31:42.860
He's not here! You've cheated on me again!

00:31:42.860 --> 00:31:43.860
- Open up! - What are we going to do?

00:31:43.860 --> 00:31:46.860
Come on, Rivero will keep the door. I'm going to get out of here.

00:31:46.860 --> 00:31:49.490
- Open up! - I'm scared.

00:31:49.490 --> 00:31:50.480
Open up!

00:32:03.160 --> 00:32:05.280
My son, come on, my son, come on, my son, come on.

00:32:05.280 --> 00:32:07.920
Leave me alone here, walk through the service door,

00:32:07.920 --> 00:32:11.400
tell the police and the firefighters quickly that I don't want to miss the train.

00:32:15.070 --> 00:32:18.400
- Oh, dad, don't come. - The owner of the apartment?

00:32:18.400 --> 00:32:19.560
Well, no.

00:32:19.560 --> 00:32:21.970
- It's a girl who just left. - It doesn't matter.

00:32:21.970 --> 00:32:24.960
- I'll get along with you. - I'm honored by you pointing at me.

00:32:24.960 --> 00:32:30.000
I am a modest employee and I understand that I can't be destined to get up more than an ex.

00:32:30.030 --> 00:32:30.810
I'll follow you here.

00:32:30.810 --> 00:32:32.490
There are as many as three.

00:32:32.490 --> 00:32:34.570
The necessities of life are so many...

00:32:34.570 --> 00:32:36.980
Open! Open, shameless!

00:32:36.980 --> 00:32:38.910
What the hell are you doing here?

00:32:41.180 --> 00:32:43.260
Shameless, you bastard!

00:32:43.260 --> 00:32:45.620
Come on, I have a little patience, there are visitors here.

00:32:45.620 --> 00:32:47.620
Open it, I'll set fire to the house.

00:32:47.620 --> 00:32:49.620
Don't listen to him, sir.

00:32:49.620 --> 00:32:51.620
I said that you pay me in the act,

00:32:51.620 --> 00:32:53.440
both to my wife and to me.

00:32:53.440 --> 00:32:55.080
Or say goodbye to your noses.

00:32:55.080 --> 00:32:59.080
Oh, gentlemen, I'm a friend of the farewells because they affect me too much and...

00:32:59.080 --> 00:32:59.760
Enough!

00:33:00.250 --> 00:33:02.760
If you don't pay me, I'll burn the house down!

00:33:02.860 --> 00:33:04.660
One more and the apple will burn.

00:33:04.760 --> 00:33:07.580
Open it once!

00:33:07.680 --> 00:33:09.350
One moment. You're right.

00:33:09.450 --> 00:33:14.350
The owner of the apartment, the one who spilled the milk on you, is there.

00:33:14.450 --> 00:33:15.550
- There? - Yes.

00:33:15.650 --> 00:33:17.750
I didn't want to let him go to avoid major trouble.

00:33:17.850 --> 00:33:20.150
But now that you're like this, you have to pay.

00:33:20.250 --> 00:33:22.670
So go and open the door and pay.

00:33:22.770 --> 00:33:23.890
Because you're paying.

00:33:23.990 --> 00:33:25.890
Don't you have any doubts?

00:33:25.990 --> 00:33:27.090
You're paying.

00:33:27.190 --> 00:33:29.090
I'm sure I'm paying!

00:33:29.190 --> 00:33:30.000
No, ma'am, let him go.

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:31.300
He's going to charge and he's coming.

00:33:34.740 --> 00:33:35.840
You bastard!

00:33:37.870 --> 00:33:38.770
-Soc! -Soc!

00:33:38.870 --> 00:33:40.070
-Bastard! -Soc!

00:33:40.270 --> 00:33:41.470
-Bastard! -Soc!

00:33:41.570 --> 00:33:42.670
-Bastard! -Soc!

00:33:42.770 --> 00:33:43.670
Bastard!

00:33:43.700 --> 00:33:46.500
Come on, come on, go crazy!

00:33:46.600 --> 00:33:47.700
-Go crazy! -Go crazy!

00:33:47.800 --> 00:33:48.900
Go crazy!

00:33:55.320 --> 00:33:57.120
This is going to happen in Córdoba!

00:33:57.220 --> 00:33:58.630
It's an iniquity!

00:33:58.730 --> 00:34:00.000
I'm going to fuck you up with...

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:13.940
Complicate! Complicate!

00:34:13.940 --> 00:34:20.990
How are you, Mrs. Aurora?

00:34:20.990 --> 00:34:24.060
- How are you? - Fine.

00:34:24.060 --> 00:34:29.860
- Has your future son-in-law arrived? - Yes, he came with the others.

00:34:30.380 --> 00:34:32.640
He made us take the plane to Río Cuarto.

00:34:32.720 --> 00:34:34.320
And you're traveling by plane?

00:34:34.440 --> 00:34:35.740
Oh, yes.

00:34:35.830 --> 00:34:38.290
This boy is capable of making miracles.

00:34:38.310 --> 00:34:43.090
He has assured me that although in other times he was a skull...

00:34:43.090 --> 00:34:46.510
...with this marriage he enters on the right path, right?

00:34:46.590 --> 00:34:49.310
Yes, he is one of the skulls that correct themselves in life.

00:34:49.390 --> 00:34:50.900
On the other hand, there are others...

00:34:50.910 --> 00:34:54.610
...who, even after being dead, are still skulls.

00:34:54.690 --> 00:34:57.860
- Are you busy? - I'm sorry, the lady is first.

00:34:57.940 --> 00:35:00.000
In that case, I congratulate you for the ride.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:02.080
Thanks. There's another one behind you, sir.

00:35:02.080 --> 00:35:03.700
When you like, miss.

00:35:03.700 --> 00:35:07.040
Laura!

00:35:07.040 --> 00:35:08.980
Sir, you're mistaken.

00:35:08.980 --> 00:35:09.910
I'm not Laura.

00:35:09.910 --> 00:35:11.410
Then what's your name, Laura?

00:35:11.410 --> 00:35:13.650
You're not the queen of the cha-cha-cha.

00:35:13.650 --> 00:35:15.110
I forbid you to keep talking.

00:35:15.110 --> 00:35:16.790
You're Alberto's model.

00:35:16.790 --> 00:35:18.750
Enough! You're making a mistake.

00:35:18.750 --> 00:35:20.620
Take a left, please.

00:35:21.960 --> 00:35:24.510
Come, come, come, come, come, come, come, come.

00:35:24.510 --> 00:35:26.420
Please follow me in that car, if you want.

00:35:26.420 --> 00:35:27.710
All right, sir.

00:35:27.710 --> 00:35:30.000
Quick, quick, my son, quick, quick.

00:35:30.190 --> 00:35:32.290
I'm going to take my niece to the altar.

00:35:32.390 --> 00:35:34.820
- That's right, sir. - Uh-huh.

00:35:34.920 --> 00:35:39.840
The son-in-law is fine, huh? He's fine.

00:35:39.940 --> 00:35:44.270
Of course, since they had exaggerated so much by telling me that he was a good boy.

00:35:44.370 --> 00:35:46.350
Oh, Pancho, what are you saying?

00:35:46.450 --> 00:35:49.400
- That he was young, that he sang... - Of course he sings.

00:35:49.500 --> 00:35:52.400
- Well, let's try it then. - I need company.

00:35:52.500 --> 00:35:54.410
What are you going to need company for?

00:35:54.510 --> 00:35:56.410
I'm going to take you to the altar.

00:35:56.510 --> 00:35:58.510
- Okay, let's go. - Let's go.

00:35:58.610 --> 00:36:00.000
- Let's go. - Let's go.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:02.000
- Beatriz, give me the guitar. - Yes, uncle.

00:36:02.000 --> 00:36:06.000
- Maybe Alberto doesn't feel like singing. - Shut up, you.

00:36:07.000 --> 00:36:09.000
Tomorrow at this hour, mother-in-law.

00:36:09.000 --> 00:36:12.000
And if the ground is good, in a little while, grandma.

00:36:12.000 --> 00:36:16.000
Francisco, what will Alberto think?

00:36:16.000 --> 00:36:19.000
Now he'll be thinking the same as I did when I was in his situation.

00:36:19.000 --> 00:36:25.000
Staying alone with his future to give him a hug or a pinch.

00:36:25.000 --> 00:36:27.000
- Fix what's nice. - The guitar, uncle.

00:36:27.000 --> 00:36:29.990
- The guitar, Uncle. - Ah, my game called me.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:30.890
You know how to go on.

00:36:43.650 --> 00:36:46.760
I saw you with fears

00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:49.760
And you, girl, accompanied me

00:36:49.760 --> 00:36:53.760
You tricked me with mania

00:36:53.760 --> 00:36:56.780
How can I not know my love?

00:36:56.780 --> 00:37:00.000
You tinkered with the flowers

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:12.000
I started to get into the legs and one of so many lookers said: "Go and ten patacones, the one of the silver tabas".

00:37:12.000 --> 00:37:30.000
The cat came out of the cage, the couples sat down and in a corner several old women.

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:33.640
They talked about the past

00:37:33.640 --> 00:37:36.280
And I who was by your side

00:37:36.280 --> 00:37:38.280
Making me innocent

00:37:38.280 --> 00:37:40.280
I saw you a kiss all of a sudden

00:37:40.280 --> 00:37:42.280
And an old woman heard the chasquido

00:37:42.280 --> 00:37:44.840
And said, "Gaucho, daring!"

00:37:44.840 --> 00:37:54.770
"Don't even respect that there's a CNP!"

00:37:54.770 --> 00:38:00.000
That caneto was playing for a long time

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:03.960
I still loved myself

00:38:03.960 --> 00:38:08.640
and I used to go to the bailongos

00:38:08.640 --> 00:38:12.580
in an anca from my azulejo

00:38:12.580 --> 00:38:16.060
today I only have the reflection

00:38:16.060 --> 00:38:17.980
of those beautiful Sundays

00:38:17.980 --> 00:38:20.060
when they married a gringo

00:38:20.060 --> 00:38:23.900
who had a lot, but a lot of money

00:38:23.900 --> 00:38:29.030
but that "carrerañata"

00:38:29.030 --> 00:38:30.000
I had it

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:43.320
The boy is bad, isn't he?

00:38:43.420 --> 00:38:47.100
To descend as we descend from the gorilla.

00:38:47.200 --> 00:38:49.200
Oh, but uncle...

00:38:51.930 --> 00:38:54.930
Well, will you come with me to take a look at the wedding dress and the gifts?

00:38:55.030 --> 00:38:55.940
Well, yes.

00:38:56.040 --> 00:38:58.940
A collection of beautiful veils has arrived.

00:38:59.040 --> 00:39:00.000
Shall we?

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:02.880
You won't tell me that I didn't prepare the ground for...

00:39:03.140 --> 00:39:05.240
- And for... - But Emilio, what are you saying?

00:39:05.440 --> 00:39:06.950
Don't tell me anything.

00:39:07.240 --> 00:39:10.820
I also did the same thing, and they all do the same thing.

00:39:16.570 --> 00:39:18.670
You know you have a pretty lively guy, don't you?

00:39:18.870 --> 00:39:22.470
But the important thing is that tomorrow comes, and as soon as they seal our blessing...

00:39:22.670 --> 00:39:24.680
Alberto, you're too impetuous.

00:39:24.880 --> 00:39:26.140
And you're too tyrant.

00:39:26.340 --> 00:39:30.000
I would have seen myself this morning in the confessional, making a relation of my sins.

00:39:30.090 --> 00:39:33.230
- What penance did he give you? - A ninth.

00:39:33.230 --> 00:39:36.010
But a ninth of kisses and hugs.

00:39:36.010 --> 00:39:37.250
That's not true.

00:39:37.250 --> 00:39:40.410
- A father can't say that. - I swear he told me.

00:39:40.410 --> 00:39:45.480
And besides, being so close to marriage, you shouldn't have opposed.

00:39:45.480 --> 00:39:50.090
If it's a matter of the father...

00:39:54.730 --> 00:39:58.680
One moment.

00:40:00.830 --> 00:40:03.010
Oh, what a pity.

00:40:04.330 --> 00:40:08.260
But whenever I find him like this, I'm surprised by his tenacity.

00:40:08.360 --> 00:40:10.340
The one that surprises me is you, ma'am.

00:40:10.420 --> 00:40:12.560
Don't get mad, it's just a hug.

00:40:12.640 --> 00:40:14.880
- Sincere? - Sincere and affectionate.

00:40:14.960 --> 00:40:17.570
I mean the zero that multiplies by ten.

00:40:17.950 --> 00:40:20.320
All right, go to the church.

00:40:20.350 --> 00:40:23.920
Talk to the priest and set the time of the ceremony yourself.

00:40:24.000 --> 00:40:26.470
As you wish, mom. See you later, see you later.

00:40:26.550 --> 00:40:30.000
And you come with me, I'm going to change.

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:45.520
- Take it, man. Take it. - The rest is for you. - Thank you. - The rest is for me. Nothing.

00:40:51.360 --> 00:41:00.000
Why don't you want to talk to me? But it's impossible, such a great match. The world is so beautiful.

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:03.340
The same guy, the same hair, the same voice.

00:41:03.340 --> 00:41:05.340
Not at all. Do you know where he is?

00:41:05.340 --> 00:41:06.700
I suppose it will be your house.

00:41:06.700 --> 00:41:08.700
No way. I come here as a visitor.

00:41:08.700 --> 00:41:10.420
And if someone comes, what do I say?

00:41:10.420 --> 00:41:11.880
You introduce me as a friend.

00:41:11.880 --> 00:41:13.880
What I will do is call to throw him out on the street.

00:41:13.880 --> 00:41:15.350
Then I will wait for you on the street.

00:41:15.350 --> 00:41:16.710
Apparently you are willing to...

00:41:16.710 --> 00:41:18.710
To convince me that you are Laura.

00:41:18.710 --> 00:41:19.710
Are you leaving?

00:41:19.710 --> 00:41:20.850
When you leave.

00:41:20.850 --> 00:41:21.850
For God's sake, Rivero.

00:41:21.850 --> 00:41:24.310
Ah, you don't know my name.

00:41:24.310 --> 00:41:26.670
Please go away, you who compromises me in a horrible way.

00:41:26.670 --> 00:41:28.670
Tell me, now less than ever.

00:41:28.670 --> 00:41:30.000
For the last time.

00:41:30.030 --> 00:41:31.730
Oh, but you can insist.

00:41:31.830 --> 00:41:33.220
Do what you want.

00:41:33.320 --> 00:41:34.820
- Have you loved him? - No.

00:41:34.920 --> 00:41:38.420
Ma'am! Ma'am! Ma'am!

00:41:38.520 --> 00:41:39.620
Who's calling?

00:41:39.720 --> 00:41:42.110
My dear Isebuta!

00:41:42.210 --> 00:41:45.510
My husband!

00:41:45.610 --> 00:41:46.910
My wife!

00:41:47.010 --> 00:41:48.690
Your husband?

00:41:48.790 --> 00:41:50.260
Your wife?

00:41:50.360 --> 00:41:52.260
But what a pleasant surprise!

00:41:52.360 --> 00:41:54.060
Sorry that there was no one at the station,

00:41:54.160 --> 00:41:56.070
but we didn't expect you until the train at night,

00:41:56.170 --> 00:41:57.270
as you had announced.

00:41:57.370 --> 00:42:00.000
Yes, but it was such anxiety that I had to see you that I...

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:03.240
- I'll have the afternoon one. - Thank you, Poroncho.

00:42:03.500 --> 00:42:06.580
But don't stay here. Come in. Come in.

00:42:08.220 --> 00:42:11.880
- Good morning, sir. - Ah, what a beautiful palace.

00:42:12.120 --> 00:42:15.820
It's not that bad. But how did you like our new house?

00:42:16.020 --> 00:42:19.220
Miss was so kind to invite me, offering me her company.

00:42:19.420 --> 00:42:22.860
You couldn't have chosen a better day than Mrs. Aurora's niece.

00:42:23.060 --> 00:42:27.490
- Ah, but Miss is the niece... - Yes, the pride of Villa Tranquila.

00:42:27.940 --> 00:42:29.410
If you like Rodríguez...

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:34.500
- Here you go. - So we've been talking without me knowing it was you.

00:42:34.500 --> 00:42:37.350
Eutacio Rocamora, a Correntino merchant.

00:42:37.350 --> 00:42:41.590
But my name is Poroncha, my husband and Beatriz's father.

00:42:41.590 --> 00:42:44.590
- It's a surprise to me. - Well, and to me?

00:42:44.590 --> 00:42:48.090
Of course. You'd think you'd meet a different woman.

00:42:48.090 --> 00:42:51.590
And you'd be surprised that having youth and that cheerful character,

00:42:51.590 --> 00:42:53.590
she makes the life she makes.

00:42:53.590 --> 00:42:56.720
Because you don't know the life she makes.

00:42:56.720 --> 00:43:00.000
Who doesn't know it, who doesn't know it...

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:02.600
- No one can appreciate it. - You say so.

00:43:02.600 --> 00:43:04.710
Well, I suppose my aunt is at home.

00:43:04.710 --> 00:43:08.350
And crazy to see her. She's in the gift room, on the upper floor.

00:43:08.350 --> 00:43:11.520
I'm flying. Then I'll go down to talk to her husband.

00:43:11.520 --> 00:43:15.250
- She's from Corrientes, right? - Yes, from Corrientes.

00:43:15.250 --> 00:43:17.050
- And Emeralda. - Why?

00:43:17.050 --> 00:43:20.420
I have a friend there, Miss Rivero.

00:43:20.420 --> 00:43:22.820
And I want her to give me some details.

00:43:22.820 --> 00:43:26.120
- And all that you want was not missing. - See you later.

00:43:26.120 --> 00:43:28.030
See you later.

00:43:30.890 --> 00:43:33.760
- Call me Poroncio. - In front of everyone else, yes.

00:43:33.760 --> 00:43:36.180
Because I have to pretend a friendship that's over.

00:43:36.180 --> 00:43:38.760
- But, dear Leonor... - You suppress adjectives.

00:43:38.760 --> 00:43:40.800
In your lips, more than praise, they offend.

00:43:40.800 --> 00:43:43.210
- And we go to our subject. - Well, as you wish.

00:43:43.210 --> 00:43:45.560
- Do you know why I called you? - Yes, Leonor, yes.

00:43:45.560 --> 00:43:46.860
Our daughter is getting married.

00:43:46.860 --> 00:43:49.770
And apart from attending the wedding, I must avoid murmurs.

00:43:49.770 --> 00:43:52.570
And once the ceremony is over, go back to normal.

00:43:52.570 --> 00:43:54.970
- Isn't that so? - Neither more nor less.

00:43:54.970 --> 00:43:57.870
However, I have the hope that the wedding will be successful.

00:43:57.870 --> 00:44:00.000
I hope so.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:03.520
I changed my mind and I can stay in Villa Tranquila, Leonor.

00:44:03.520 --> 00:44:05.960
- I assure you... - You're dead to me.

00:44:05.960 --> 00:44:07.960
You didn't kill me with that coldness.

00:44:07.960 --> 00:44:12.420
Not being able to publish your scandals, I said that you had dedicated yourself to business on the streets.

00:44:12.420 --> 00:44:17.200
And that your businesses were so important that they didn't allow you to leave them frequently.

00:44:17.200 --> 00:44:19.660
Yes, you framed me on the streets and there I will die.

00:44:19.660 --> 00:44:21.650
You can die wherever you want.

00:44:21.650 --> 00:44:25.130
But I had to take care of my daughter's name and defend her as much as possible.

00:44:25.130 --> 00:44:27.050
Don't be such a fool.

00:44:27.050 --> 00:44:30.000
Who knows that during the time that I confess, I was something more...

00:44:30.220 --> 00:44:35.220
To avoid the danger that you point out, I adopted a supposed man and continued using him.

00:44:35.220 --> 00:44:39.040
It's the only delicacy that I know of, but I already knew it.

00:44:39.040 --> 00:44:42.900
As soon as the priest marries you, peace ends.

00:44:42.900 --> 00:44:44.860
At least you could have told me who my daughter marries.

00:44:44.860 --> 00:44:46.860
As soon as I return, I'll introduce him to you.

00:44:46.860 --> 00:44:49.720
It's okay, Leonor. What you do is fine.

00:44:49.720 --> 00:44:51.670
So, we're still the same.

00:44:51.670 --> 00:44:52.670
To death.

00:44:52.670 --> 00:44:55.440
Ungrateful, with what I love you.

00:44:55.440 --> 00:44:59.800
Ungrateful, have you forgotten all the things you've done to me?

00:45:00.160 --> 00:45:05.490
With my friends, with the fashionistas, and even with the mucamas.

00:45:05.510 --> 00:45:07.970
And well, most of the blame was on you.

00:45:07.990 --> 00:45:11.150
- Me? - You.

00:45:11.210 --> 00:45:13.290
You have to see the mucamas you put on me.

00:45:13.320 --> 00:45:16.980
The one who wasn't a divito type was blonde with caramel eyes

00:45:17.000 --> 00:45:18.650
or black-eyed brunette.

00:45:18.670 --> 00:45:22.300
The one who wasn't 18 years old was 17.

00:45:22.380 --> 00:45:26.060
That, Leonor, that shouldn't be done by a married woman.

00:45:26.080 --> 00:45:27.770
But what are you saying?

00:45:27.790 --> 00:45:30.000
I say that that is equivalent to forcing the husband

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:31.900
by the roof of the house.

00:45:31.900 --> 00:45:33.500
I told him not to make a fuss.

00:45:33.500 --> 00:45:35.360
I didn't think he'd get mad,

00:45:35.360 --> 00:45:37.360
and if he doesn't grab the first thing he finds,

00:45:37.360 --> 00:45:38.360
he'll fall.

00:45:38.360 --> 00:45:39.360
And you fell.

00:45:39.360 --> 00:45:41.230
Fall? Never!

00:45:41.230 --> 00:45:43.090
I grabbed so I wouldn't fall.

00:45:43.090 --> 00:45:45.090
You're still as cynical as before.

00:45:45.090 --> 00:45:46.580
What I have to hear.

00:45:46.580 --> 00:45:49.110
After living a life of regret in Buenos Aires

00:45:49.110 --> 00:45:50.610
for three years.

00:45:50.610 --> 00:45:52.430
A life of regret?

00:45:52.430 --> 00:45:54.430
Believe me, Leonor, I'm different.

00:45:54.430 --> 00:45:57.100
Will you let me stay for at least a week?

00:45:57.100 --> 00:46:00.000
It's ugly for me to leave in such a hurry.

00:46:00.120 --> 00:46:02.120
And that will depend on your behavior.

00:46:02.120 --> 00:46:04.120
Then I love you all my life.

00:46:04.120 --> 00:46:07.980
You'll see, you'll feel proud of having a husband like me.

00:46:07.980 --> 00:46:09.980
- Don't move, Negro. - I'm sorry.

00:46:09.980 --> 00:46:11.980
- Don't move, don't be crazy. - I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:46:11.980 --> 00:46:13.980
- I'm sorry, I'm sorry. - I don't want to, well, that's it.

00:46:13.980 --> 00:46:15.980
- That's a joke. - Oh, how crazy you are.

00:46:15.980 --> 00:46:17.860
Well, that's it.

00:46:18.710 --> 00:46:21.600
- Excuse me, do you think you're done? - Yes, daughter.

00:46:21.600 --> 00:46:25.610
- We're done. - I'm at your... I mean, at your disposal.

00:46:25.610 --> 00:46:28.620
It's about a question about our friend. Simple curiosity.

00:46:28.620 --> 00:46:30.000
Well, I'll tell you.

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:33.360
I'm going to check the food, because a woman can't eat too much.

00:46:33.400 --> 00:46:35.960
Listen, send me a cup of tea with something.

00:46:36.200 --> 00:46:38.360
Some biscochitos, a tostadita...

00:46:38.400 --> 00:46:40.080
- Well... - Ah! A bit of cognac.

00:46:40.410 --> 00:46:42.250
Very little. You're not going to add too much.

00:46:42.590 --> 00:46:43.990
You know that alcohol is for me.

00:46:44.510 --> 00:46:46.230
A spoonful, more or less?

00:46:46.430 --> 00:46:47.430
I don't know.

00:46:47.700 --> 00:46:49.020
Look, it's better to send the bottle.

00:46:49.410 --> 00:46:51.410
I know you and I'm afraid you'll go too far.

00:46:51.850 --> 00:46:53.730
Well, I'll leave you with a santa.

00:46:54.050 --> 00:46:56.130
- For God's sake, ma'am. - What did you hear?

00:46:56.330 --> 00:46:57.340
A santa.

00:46:59.380 --> 00:47:00.000
No.

00:47:01.690 --> 00:47:04.670
- What a saint you are! - Look at you, a merchant.

00:47:04.670 --> 00:47:08.430
- Why is your name Sisebuta? - Because that's my real name.

00:47:08.430 --> 00:47:10.900
Sisebuta Segunda Rodríguez.

00:47:10.900 --> 00:47:14.010
Do you think Alberto would have conquered you by calling me Sisebuta?

00:47:14.010 --> 00:47:15.310
You're right, my dear.

00:47:15.310 --> 00:47:18.770
With Sisebuta, no one dares to say a loving phrase.

00:47:18.770 --> 00:47:21.090
There you have the cause of the change in my name.

00:47:21.090 --> 00:47:23.510
- And you? - Well, I separated from my wife...

00:47:23.510 --> 00:47:26.820
...because she caught me pecking at a mucama and I had to go to Buenos Aires.

00:47:26.820 --> 00:47:30.000
There you pretended to be single to continue your whims and you changed your name.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:33.420
- What do you mean? - Who does your daughter marry?

00:47:33.420 --> 00:47:36.650
You think I don't know yet? My wife says it's a miracle.

00:47:36.650 --> 00:47:39.050
I know he arrived this morning, but I haven't seen him either.

00:47:39.050 --> 00:47:41.450
I'm sorry the party ends here, in the family.

00:47:41.450 --> 00:47:43.430
We're not going anywhere with the family.

00:47:43.430 --> 00:47:46.670
Imagine yourself in Buenos Aires, dancing with me...

00:47:46.670 --> 00:47:49.070
...and Alberto singing a tango.

00:47:49.070 --> 00:47:52.140
Alberto, to think I'll be three months without seeing him...

00:47:52.140 --> 00:47:54.120
...to tell him that you're as faithful to me as I am to him...

00:47:54.120 --> 00:47:55.920
What do you want me to tell you?

00:47:55.920 --> 00:48:00.000
Rivero, don't start to wake up suspicions in me to bitter my life.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:02.000
Fine, I didn't say anything.

00:48:02.000 --> 00:48:05.140
Well, now I'm going to the church to look for the prayer...

00:48:05.140 --> 00:48:08.100
...that your daughter has to pray on her last night as a single.

00:48:08.100 --> 00:48:09.930
You know we have dinner together.

00:48:09.930 --> 00:48:10.930
Let's see if you don't put the potato.

00:48:10.930 --> 00:48:15.930
Maybe under the table, if they put a pimponjo like you in front of me.

00:48:15.930 --> 00:48:18.240
You are incorrigible.

00:48:18.240 --> 00:48:19.240
No.

00:48:19.240 --> 00:48:20.410
Good morning.

00:48:20.410 --> 00:48:21.320
Good morning.

00:48:21.320 --> 00:48:23.410
But what am I seeing?

00:48:23.410 --> 00:48:26.340
The lady sends me to serve you the tea she has asked for.

00:48:26.340 --> 00:48:28.630
My mother, my mother.

00:48:28.630 --> 00:48:30.000
Do you feel bad?

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:32.000
This is putting one in the basket.

00:48:32.000 --> 00:48:33.000
What does it say?

00:48:33.000 --> 00:48:35.000
Tell me, has it been a long time since you worked in the house?

00:48:35.000 --> 00:48:36.000
Three months.

00:48:36.000 --> 00:48:37.830
Do you serve yourself or do I serve you?

00:48:37.830 --> 00:48:38.830
You, rich woman, you.

00:48:38.830 --> 00:48:39.830
Do I serve you sugar?

00:48:39.830 --> 00:48:41.170
Serve.

00:48:42.170 --> 00:48:43.150
Wow, if you serve.

00:48:43.150 --> 00:48:44.390
Do you like it very sweet?

00:48:44.390 --> 00:48:45.500
As you like it.

00:48:45.500 --> 00:48:48.540
Don't trust me, I like very sweet things.

00:48:48.540 --> 00:48:50.540
Look at me, I'm made of a candy.

00:48:50.540 --> 00:48:51.540
You have a good mood.

00:48:51.540 --> 00:48:52.540
What's your name?

00:48:52.540 --> 00:48:53.540
Titina.

00:48:53.540 --> 00:48:54.540
Listen to me, Titina.

00:48:54.540 --> 00:48:58.590
Or open your arms so I can fall on them, or I'll open them for you.

00:48:58.590 --> 00:48:59.420
Titina.

00:48:59.420 --> 00:49:00.000
Titina.

00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:02.000
- But sir... - Don't be bad.

00:49:02.000 --> 00:49:04.000
- What a scream! - How nice.

00:49:04.000 --> 00:49:06.000
- What a scream! - How nice!

00:49:06.000 --> 00:49:08.110
Oh, shut up!

00:49:08.110 --> 00:49:10.110
- Sir... - My wife...

00:49:10.110 --> 00:49:12.110
- You've gone too far. - Go and look for your things.

00:49:12.110 --> 00:49:14.110
- I'll tell you later. - But, sir...

00:49:14.110 --> 00:49:15.290
Go, I said!

00:49:15.290 --> 00:49:18.290
It's a mechanical thing. Completely mechanical.

00:49:18.290 --> 00:49:20.300
You insist on walking me through the alley.

00:49:20.300 --> 00:49:23.300
The vertigo comes over you and you see what happens.

00:49:23.300 --> 00:49:25.280
You don't have an amendment.

00:49:25.280 --> 00:49:27.320
- But soon you'll go forever. - No, sir.

00:49:27.320 --> 00:49:30.000
- Because if you acquire the owner, I'm your husband. - No, sir.

00:49:30.250 --> 00:49:32.050
- What is that name? - Yes, sir, your husband.

00:49:32.150 --> 00:49:34.150
The one who must share the warmth of the house with you.

00:49:34.250 --> 00:49:36.050
With me or with the mucamas?

00:49:36.150 --> 00:49:38.320
Oh, well, where do you get them from?

00:49:38.330 --> 00:49:40.510
You have to see the poor thing, how she has developed.

00:49:40.610 --> 00:49:41.970
And I repeat myself, eh?

00:49:41.980 --> 00:49:44.240
Tomorrow, as soon as the ceremony is over,

00:49:44.340 --> 00:49:46.240
you leave this house forever.

00:49:46.260 --> 00:49:48.950
Did you hear me? Forever!

00:49:48.960 --> 00:49:50.870
All right, forever.

00:50:15.870 --> 00:50:17.030
But what's this?

00:50:17.030 --> 00:50:18.510
It's to shoot yourself!

00:50:18.510 --> 00:50:21.020
Have they invited you?

00:50:21.020 --> 00:50:23.760
Look, don't be cynical, get out of here immediately!

00:50:23.760 --> 00:50:25.040
Don't yell at me, okay?

00:50:25.040 --> 00:50:27.430
Because if you keep like this, I'm the one who's going to kick you out.

00:50:27.430 --> 00:50:30.000
And I don't call the maid because she has a prettier one

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:34.000
- What's going on? What are you yelling about? - I don't know how this individual got here.

00:50:34.000 --> 00:50:38.000
- But I don't know him. - He's your future political father.

00:50:38.000 --> 00:50:39.000
- No! - Yes!

00:50:39.000 --> 00:50:41.000
- My father-in-law! - My son-in-law?

00:50:41.000 --> 00:50:45.000
Yes, your son-in-law, Alberto Morales, who will be your daughter's husband tomorrow.

00:50:45.000 --> 00:50:47.890
- Nice to meet you, sir. - And go, my son, go.

00:50:47.890 --> 00:50:49.890
- And? - What do you think?

00:50:49.890 --> 00:50:52.890
I like the boy, I like him.

00:50:52.890 --> 00:50:54.810
Your beautiful son-in-law.

00:50:54.810 --> 00:50:57.870
Well, but what's going on? Are they going to kill us out of hunger?

00:50:57.870 --> 00:51:00.000
You're introducing my husband, Alberto.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:04.640
It's been a long time. How are you, Corrientes?

00:51:04.640 --> 00:51:06.080
Always in the same place.

00:51:06.080 --> 00:51:08.740
I find you very spoiled.

00:51:08.740 --> 00:51:11.110
Very drunk, with dark circles.

00:51:11.950 --> 00:51:14.450
How must you have run over there, huh?

00:51:14.450 --> 00:51:15.950
Yes, yes, very fast.

00:51:15.950 --> 00:51:18.110
Oh, my dear Papito.

00:51:18.110 --> 00:51:20.490
- How are you? - I'm fine, and you?

00:51:20.490 --> 00:51:21.950
- Fine, very fine. - And?

00:51:21.950 --> 00:51:23.970
- What did you think, Alberto? - Very good, boy.

00:51:23.970 --> 00:51:26.570
- Ah, did you see? - And you'll see how it looks.

00:51:26.570 --> 00:51:30.000
- How did you know? - No, but the appearance is good.

00:51:30.030 --> 00:51:34.340
There's nerves, there's lines, oh, what a mess.

00:51:34.540 --> 00:51:36.660
Well, shall we eat or not?

00:51:36.860 --> 00:51:39.040
Let's wait a little, my sister-in-law.

00:51:39.240 --> 00:51:42.080
- But more, still. - Of course we have to wait.

00:51:42.280 --> 00:51:46.890
- What's wrong with you, Cheta? - The surprise.

00:51:47.090 --> 00:51:49.570
The surprise that you're going to get in a little while.

00:51:49.770 --> 00:51:52.390
- And it will take a long time, if you like it. - No, they're here.

00:51:52.590 --> 00:51:54.990
- Anyway, we could go to the dining room. - Yes, that's right.

00:51:55.190 --> 00:51:57.000
Dad, give a hug to Mrs. Aurora and mom.

00:51:57.200 --> 00:52:00.000
- With great pleasure. - Uncle Francisco.

00:52:00.090 --> 00:52:02.430
- You're coming with me. - And I'm going alone?

00:52:02.730 --> 00:52:06.780
I didn't lie to you. I reserved you the most charming and good girl of the meeting.

00:52:13.930 --> 00:52:16.210
Then the parrot that was listening said:

00:52:16.510 --> 00:52:20.010
- Give me a letter too. - Very good, very good.

00:52:20.210 --> 00:52:21.810
- Did you like it? - The wine is very good, I say.

00:52:22.010 --> 00:52:24.310
- Daddy! - You have no arrangement.

00:52:24.510 --> 00:52:25.330
And good.

00:52:28.330 --> 00:52:29.700
I'm on time.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:31.980
Come on, if you want to throw it.

00:52:32.980 --> 00:52:34.580
You arrived just in time, dear.

00:52:34.780 --> 00:52:36.980
The lady, if you want to throw it, my promise.

00:52:37.800 --> 00:52:39.800
- Your what? - The rainbow!

00:52:40.000 --> 00:52:42.400
- Oh, the rainbow! - Oh, it's so pretty!

00:52:42.600 --> 00:52:44.200
- Come and get it! - I'm going to throw it.

00:52:44.400 --> 00:52:47.230
- Oh, water, come on! - Water?

00:52:47.640 --> 00:52:48.840
Better wine.

00:52:49.040 --> 00:52:51.040
I'm going to serve myself to something!

00:52:51.240 --> 00:52:53.040
I'm going to serve myself to something!

00:52:54.050 --> 00:52:57.250
- What's the end? - No, just now, when the mess begins.

00:52:57.450 --> 00:53:00.000
Something had to happen so that I wouldn't eat.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:02.000
I'm going to pay for this pimp.

00:53:02.530 --> 00:53:04.130
And the canary of Rivero.

00:53:04.290 --> 00:53:05.770
He cheated on me.

00:53:06.100 --> 00:53:07.500
A drugstore.

00:53:07.740 --> 00:53:09.740
A glass and a half of vitriol.

00:53:09.980 --> 00:53:11.740
Both of me cured.

00:53:11.820 --> 00:53:13.820
Oh, what a strange delirium.

00:53:14.220 --> 00:53:16.740
Yes, yes, there will be danger.

00:53:16.820 --> 00:53:19.860
The danger begins now, the delirium, the delirium that aggravates.

00:53:19.940 --> 00:53:22.100
Hear me, hear me, hear me, what do you say?

00:53:22.180 --> 00:53:25.350
Horrible, Rivero, horrible, because if she wakes up and talks to Beatriz,

00:53:25.430 --> 00:53:26.830
I won't tell you anything about what's going on.

00:53:26.910 --> 00:53:30.000
The scandal, the vitriol, the burned face, listen.

00:53:30.090 --> 00:53:32.960
That bastard Rivero didn't tell me anything.

00:53:33.160 --> 00:53:35.100
Dead! Dead!

00:53:35.300 --> 00:53:38.390
If he's not dead, I won't be able to rest in peace.

00:53:38.590 --> 00:53:39.590
What's wrong with you?

00:53:39.790 --> 00:53:41.790
Nothing, nothing.

00:53:41.990 --> 00:53:44.910
Tomorrow we're going to have big news.

00:53:45.110 --> 00:54:00.000
We're going to La Estancia, to Rocamo.

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:08.470
It's necessary, Laura, to convince her and for that, no one better than you.

00:54:08.470 --> 00:54:13.470
All right. Since you still haven't gone through the drugstore to buy the dithiolo, I'll talk to you.

00:54:13.470 --> 00:54:15.390
- I'm sorry, Paz. - Will that be the one?

00:54:15.390 --> 00:54:16.390
I don't know.

00:54:19.920 --> 00:54:23.720
I'm sorry, Paz. I'm sorry.

00:54:32.880 --> 00:54:34.860
- Sir? - Are you the new Mukama?

00:54:34.860 --> 00:54:36.860
Yes, to serve you.

00:54:36.860 --> 00:54:41.750
Tell me, is this fat a prodigal nature or is it a phobia?

00:54:41.750 --> 00:54:43.660
I don't know what you mean, sir.

00:54:43.660 --> 00:54:47.660
That if this masochism is permanent, because there are people who cheat, you know?

00:54:47.660 --> 00:54:50.570
- I don't cheat anyone. - Good.

00:54:50.570 --> 00:54:53.660
This is the law of compensation.

00:54:53.660 --> 00:54:57.650
You're not a beauty, but you're not bad like this.

00:54:57.650 --> 00:55:00.000
- You're not going to be bad. - Sir.

00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:01.700
What do you want, sir?

00:55:01.700 --> 00:55:02.960
Shut up, Fuenta.

00:55:02.960 --> 00:55:05.700
Is it to prove it or do you think I have any interest?

00:55:05.700 --> 00:55:09.670
No, I hug you like I could hug a brother or a father.

00:55:09.670 --> 00:55:11.650
The one who hugged you like that, your father.

00:55:12.110 --> 00:55:15.540
Old green! Shameless!

00:55:15.540 --> 00:55:17.190
Sopanora, go to your room.

00:55:17.190 --> 00:55:18.390
I'll adjust the bill.

00:55:18.390 --> 00:55:22.090
But you're the one who told me about the hug of my father.

00:55:22.090 --> 00:55:23.090
Yes, Leonor, listen to me.

00:55:23.090 --> 00:55:25.390
It was an order that your father had given me.

00:55:25.390 --> 00:55:27.300
Enough! Take a rest.

00:55:27.300 --> 00:55:28.840
All right, ma'am.

00:55:28.840 --> 00:55:30.000
Now you don't have a husband.

00:55:30.220 --> 00:55:32.220
What about the cornice? What about the beauty?

00:55:32.220 --> 00:55:34.680
Because it's uglier than that, it's impossible.

00:55:34.680 --> 00:55:36.700
Of course, of course, nothing more.

00:55:36.700 --> 00:55:38.690
But you forget about the surroundings.

00:55:38.690 --> 00:55:41.740
And you're not going to deny me that you have them, as if to take a motorbike ride.

00:55:41.740 --> 00:55:43.740
What a shame to hear you.

00:55:43.740 --> 00:55:47.580
Leonor, you judge me like a criminal, and I'm a sick person.

00:55:47.580 --> 00:55:49.020
Sick?

00:55:49.020 --> 00:55:52.920
Yes, that which to you seems infidelity is really morbid.

00:55:52.920 --> 00:55:57.880
I embrace mechanically, automatically.

00:55:57.880 --> 00:56:00.000
All right. When he's cured, he'll be able to...

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:02.680
the hope that this house will not be covered.

00:56:02.800 --> 00:56:04.600
- Hey! - Green light, blue light!

00:56:04.720 --> 00:56:08.360
- I'm going to be ashamed. - Listen to me, Leonor, look, I...

00:56:10.760 --> 00:56:14.130
- Where are you going? - To worship a wretch who has deceived me.

00:56:14.250 --> 00:56:16.410
That wretch is my future political son.

00:56:16.810 --> 00:56:20.450
- They are going to meet, just for what? - Dear Laura, I know how to reason.

00:56:20.570 --> 00:56:24.690
I don't want reasons! In order to avenge myself, everything, everything!

00:56:25.160 --> 00:56:29.010
- That's how I'll get rid of my aunt. - It's crazy to throw a reputation on the ground,

00:56:29.130 --> 00:56:30.000
to lose a family heritage.

00:56:30.060 --> 00:56:34.060
and all for a man, a man who only keeps a pleasant memory of you.

00:56:34.060 --> 00:56:39.060
Yes, your reasoning is not bad, but I'm nervous, very excited.

00:56:39.060 --> 00:56:43.060
On the one hand, I understand that this man does not deserve anything more than my contempt,

00:56:43.060 --> 00:56:46.140
but on the other, I do not know, I do not know.

00:56:46.140 --> 00:56:47.140
Where are you going?

00:56:47.140 --> 00:56:52.960
To take a little breath, to decide what I should do, but alone, completely alone.

00:56:52.960 --> 00:56:54.960
Promise me one thing.

00:56:54.960 --> 00:56:55.880
What?

00:56:55.880 --> 00:56:59.860
Whatever your decision is, you will communicate it to me before putting it into practice.

00:57:00.920 --> 00:57:30.000
I'll tell you.

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:32.220
I went to talk to my cousin's traitor.

00:57:32.420 --> 00:57:36.240
I wanted to kill a man I didn't know, so I was arrested.

00:57:36.440 --> 00:57:40.040
I spent 15 days in a terrible delirium. He's a bastard!

00:57:40.240 --> 00:57:42.940
- Don't use that language! - It's impossible.

00:57:43.140 --> 00:57:46.740
What I don't understand is how you are trying to seduce...

00:57:46.940 --> 00:57:50.840
...a libertine like Alberto, who has the audacity to introduce here...

00:57:51.040 --> 00:57:54.040
...in his own house, the last of his lovers.

00:57:54.240 --> 00:57:57.190
- What are you saying? - What am I saying?

00:57:57.390 --> 00:58:00.000
- Do me a favor, ma'am. - No, no, no.

00:58:00.030 --> 00:58:02.030
I don't know, I don't know what you're thinking.

00:58:03.030 --> 00:58:05.000
Do you know this lady?

00:58:05.000 --> 00:58:07.170
I don't know her. She's a saint.

00:58:07.170 --> 00:58:09.410
A saint?

00:58:09.410 --> 00:58:12.270
She's a model, ma'am. A model of a painter.

00:58:12.270 --> 00:58:14.270
Your son-in-law's little friend.

00:58:14.270 --> 00:58:16.270
Who? Is she crazy?

00:58:16.270 --> 00:58:18.270
You're crazy.

00:58:18.270 --> 00:58:20.990
- Leonor. - Excuse me.

00:58:20.990 --> 00:58:25.120
Leonor, we've been waiting for you.

00:58:25.120 --> 00:58:27.120
Who is that man who seems so angry?

00:58:27.120 --> 00:58:30.000
Paulo, Beatriz's first boyfriend.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:31.400
The one who was so bored.

00:58:31.400 --> 00:58:33.400
He wants to have an interview with Alberto.

00:58:33.400 --> 00:58:36.850
He told me he was a bit crazy, but I think he's out of his mind.

00:58:36.850 --> 00:58:39.860
He says Alberto brought Zébuta here because he's his lover.

00:58:39.860 --> 00:58:40.820
He's smart.

00:58:40.820 --> 00:58:43.580
And that Zébuta is a model of a happy life.

00:58:43.580 --> 00:58:45.110
I'm very scared.

00:58:45.110 --> 00:58:47.200
It's for a shirt of strength.

00:58:47.200 --> 00:58:50.260
If you could wisely tell him to leave...

00:58:50.260 --> 00:58:53.100
Leave it to me.

00:58:53.100 --> 00:58:56.670
Go inside, Beatriz needed you.

00:58:56.670 --> 00:58:58.640
Just a second, I'll be right back.

00:58:58.640 --> 00:59:00.000
- Ma'am... - Come in.

00:59:00.060 --> 00:59:05.180
Tell me, it's urgent, but in your place I'm staying, I'm the brother.

00:59:05.380 --> 00:59:08.380
Well, but I need to know if Alberto is going to receive me.

00:59:08.580 --> 00:59:11.080
He's very busy preparing for the wedding.

00:59:11.280 --> 00:59:12.510
Wedding?

00:59:12.710 --> 00:59:17.990
Could you tell me what pretext you used to attract this lady who's in the garden?

00:59:18.190 --> 00:59:19.730
In the garden?

00:59:25.380 --> 00:59:26.980
The lady does like it.

00:59:27.180 --> 00:59:30.000
What do you mean, she likes it? Laura!

00:59:30.220 --> 00:59:35.660
In the garden there is more than one person.

00:59:35.660 --> 00:59:38.360
- Well, that one. - The model of Alberto.

00:59:38.360 --> 00:59:40.320
- Have you decided, Laura? - I'll tell you.

00:59:40.320 --> 00:59:43.430
- What? - I think that...

00:59:43.430 --> 00:59:47.350
But how? This shameless one is also here.

00:59:47.350 --> 00:59:50.230
- Now you're going to pay me the lock. - Yes.

00:59:50.230 --> 00:59:55.830
- Just like? - It's very serious.

00:59:55.830 --> 00:59:59.760
I am the owner who is behind and I forbid you to put your feet here again.

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.320
- You're confused. - Confused?

01:00:02.420 --> 01:00:04.920
So, you're not Rivero, Alberto's friend?

01:00:05.020 --> 01:00:07.040
No, sir, there's no such Rivero.

01:00:07.620 --> 01:00:11.790
It's Eustaquio Rocamora, Correntino's salesman and Mrs. Leonor's husband.

01:00:11.990 --> 01:00:14.290
So, this man is Beatriz's father?

01:00:14.390 --> 01:00:17.990
- This man, yes, sir. - So, I'm in short service?

01:00:18.090 --> 01:00:19.470
Of course you are.

01:00:19.570 --> 01:00:21.970
And the best thing you can do is get out before I call the police.

01:00:22.070 --> 01:00:24.140
No, sir, I'm not crazy.

01:00:24.200 --> 01:00:26.600
This guy is Rivero and the other is Laura.

01:00:26.700 --> 01:00:28.210
We have to call Alberto here.

01:00:28.310 --> 01:00:30.000
I'll do that interview with him myself.

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:32.200
- Open this door. - Ha! Another lock!

01:00:32.200 --> 01:00:34.200
- Keep it safe. - Of course I'll keep it!

01:00:34.200 --> 01:00:35.600
And I'll drink it if I want to.

01:00:38.160 --> 01:00:41.010
I'll be right back with Alberto.

01:00:41.010 --> 01:00:44.130
Here we have to welcome the guests, you'll understand.

01:00:44.130 --> 01:00:45.270
All right.

01:00:45.270 --> 01:00:48.770
Here I keep the body in place.

01:00:48.770 --> 01:00:50.200
We're going to talk to you later.

01:00:52.330 --> 01:00:54.130
Why didn't you let me call the police?

01:00:54.130 --> 01:00:55.430
You have to avoid the scandal.

01:00:55.430 --> 01:00:58.620
I'll talk to Alberto, we'll see how to send him to Buenos Aires.

01:00:58.620 --> 01:00:59.800
Oh my God!

01:01:08.670 --> 01:01:10.820
- In the office. - You'll see, you're like me.

01:01:10.820 --> 01:01:12.820
Try to get closer.

01:01:13.930 --> 01:01:16.910
Mr. Judge, what an honor!

01:01:16.910 --> 01:01:18.910
My good friend, Mrs. Leonor.

01:01:18.910 --> 01:01:21.910
- My dear Lola. - Don Francisco.

01:01:21.910 --> 01:01:23.910
- Doctor. - Every day more beautiful.

01:01:24.910 --> 01:01:27.550
But what's wrong with you? Are you nervous?

01:01:27.550 --> 01:01:30.000
It's just that we just had a very important visit.

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:33.020
A friend of mine, the poor guy went crazy.

01:01:33.020 --> 01:01:35.000
Crazy? Of those who hit?

01:01:35.000 --> 01:01:35.900
Yes, yes, yes.

01:01:35.900 --> 01:01:38.710
Damn, and could you throw him out?

01:01:38.710 --> 01:01:40.710
He's waiting for my son-in-law.

01:01:40.710 --> 01:01:44.710
Excuse me, ma'am, I think that in this case the best thing is to call the police.

01:01:44.710 --> 01:01:46.850
With a couple, that's enough.

01:01:46.850 --> 01:01:47.850
Here's the couple!

01:01:47.850 --> 01:01:51.190
- -

01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:05.820
You, if I remember correctly, are the mathematician, aren't you?

01:02:05.860 --> 01:02:08.360
And you, if I'm not mistaken...

01:02:08.400 --> 01:02:11.860
...are you the Laura that I had the pleasure of meeting in the studio?

01:02:11.880 --> 01:02:13.210
Not here, sir.

01:02:13.290 --> 01:02:14.950
I'm Shisebuta.

01:02:14.970 --> 01:02:16.720
Then I'm not crazy?

01:02:16.810 --> 01:02:17.980
I don't know.

01:02:18.020 --> 01:02:20.780
But can you tell me what you're doing with that strange revolver?

01:02:20.800 --> 01:02:24.580
It's a copy of another that I own and I want to see if they sell it to me.

01:02:24.600 --> 01:02:27.220
When I saw him, everyone ran away.

01:02:27.900 --> 01:02:29.640
Apparently he's afraid of you.

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:34.230
Well, the truth is that what your cousin has done with you deserves a revenge.

01:02:37.040 --> 01:02:39.040
You should kill Alberto and your girlfriend.

01:02:39.260 --> 01:02:42.150
And you should behead Beatriz and your boyfriend.

01:02:42.350 --> 01:02:45.150
No man deserves a woman to get lost because of him.

01:02:45.350 --> 01:02:46.580
I thought the same.

01:02:46.960 --> 01:02:50.260
There is no woman who deserves a man to get lost because of her.

01:02:50.420 --> 01:02:53.220
Man is the most unworthy being of creation.

01:02:53.420 --> 01:02:55.070
Woman is the pinnacle of life.

01:02:55.270 --> 01:02:56.670
And that makes me do it.

01:02:56.920 --> 01:02:59.030
I made a mystery out of my life because of him.

01:02:59.210 --> 01:03:00.000
To be able to tell him.

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:04.080
Here you go, Bohemian. There you go, five million pesos!

01:03:04.120 --> 01:03:08.170
Victory! Defeat! We're going to enjoy it happily!

01:03:08.190 --> 01:03:12.880
Five million pesos, you said?

01:03:12.900 --> 01:03:16.920
Yes, all the fortunes that my aunt will give me will be part of her death.

01:03:16.940 --> 01:03:18.790
And she'll ascend to that according to her fortune.

01:03:18.810 --> 01:03:21.790
And she has abundant years, her aunt?

01:03:21.810 --> 01:03:27.090
Many. The unhappy one. She has one foot here, and another there.

01:03:27.130 --> 01:03:30.000
So, the day you get her...

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:40.110
Don't you think it's strange that we both have the same and have the same determination?

01:03:40.110 --> 01:03:41.810
True, it's strange, isn't it?

01:03:41.810 --> 01:03:46.180
Haven't you heard that in life we come in the shape of an orange half,

01:03:46.180 --> 01:03:49.380
and until we find the other half, there's no roundness?

01:03:49.380 --> 01:03:52.600
Who knows if your orange half is me or not?

01:03:52.600 --> 01:03:55.060
You, my orange half?

01:03:55.060 --> 01:03:57.540
You don't even serve me for a soda.

01:03:57.540 --> 01:04:00.000
You don't even serve me for a soda.

01:04:00.160 --> 01:04:04.400
- But why? - Because I have a character completely opposite to yours.

01:04:04.540 --> 01:04:07.040
To me, seriousness and mathematics crush me.

01:04:07.850 --> 01:04:14.410
Precisely what I liked about Alberto was his joy, his bohemian life, his splendor.

01:04:14.550 --> 01:04:16.690
Aha! Very good!

01:04:17.500 --> 01:04:22.520
- What? - I'm not what I look like, I'm a cheerful guy and a hypocrite.

01:04:22.860 --> 01:04:25.950
- He's funny. - Regularly funny.

01:04:26.310 --> 01:04:30.000
Oh, if you decided and accepted me as your medium,

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:36.720
would see how different and once his aunt passes by the horizontal we were going to london to

01:04:36.720 --> 01:04:43.440
spend the joy and why to london because in the black city and then to evoke other times

01:04:43.440 --> 01:04:53.370
good but the pagan who would be rome or me rome in the past you in the present if you want

01:04:53.370 --> 01:04:59.700
to see the sweetness of life support in this gaucho arm so that later I will be left planted just like alberto

01:04:59.700 --> 01:05:00.000
I'm sorry.

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:03.800
It's just that I'm not only offering you my arm, but I'm asking for your hand.

01:05:03.900 --> 01:05:05.200
Would you marry me?

01:05:05.300 --> 01:05:07.500
But you're not reading into my eyes.

01:05:07.600 --> 01:05:12.000
Look at the bottom of the girl and you'll see a priestess doing this,

01:05:12.100 --> 01:05:14.400
the priestess asking for the tip,

01:05:14.500 --> 01:05:17.000
and you giving it to her because I don't take change.

01:05:17.100 --> 01:05:18.700
What a surprise you're going to take!

01:05:18.800 --> 01:05:21.200
The same as you waiting for war from me.

01:05:21.300 --> 01:05:24.900
And we're going to introduce ourselves with the olive branch in the piquito.

01:05:25.220 --> 01:05:26.720
And speaking of piquito,

01:05:26.820 --> 01:05:30.000
Why don't you send me a kiss on account of a bigger sum?

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:31.340
A little kiss.

01:05:31.340 --> 01:05:33.100
Let's see, close your eyes.

01:05:37.240 --> 01:05:39.880
Life has to be taken with soda.

01:05:39.880 --> 01:05:43.500
To laugh at the problems.

01:05:43.500 --> 01:05:46.920
Not to hurt yourself in blood or in jokes.

01:05:46.920 --> 01:05:50.460
The sorrows are always sorrows.

01:05:50.460 --> 01:05:52.180
What's wrong with you?

01:05:52.180 --> 01:05:53.890
Why are you so funny?

01:05:53.890 --> 01:05:57.190
You, who have always been so boring,

01:05:57.190 --> 01:05:59.070
but what's wrong with you?

01:05:59.070 --> 01:06:00.000
And now you want

01:06:00.120 --> 01:06:04.120
change and throw everything to oblivion, the best to oblivion.

01:06:08.270 --> 01:06:12.270
Don't be afraid, if you're crazy I'm saying I don't know where my head is.

01:06:12.270 --> 01:06:13.270
But Alberto!

01:06:13.270 --> 01:06:15.270
If you want war, you'll have war.

01:06:15.270 --> 01:06:17.270
But what the hell?

01:06:17.270 --> 01:06:19.240
It's madness!

01:06:20.090 --> 01:06:22.170
What do you tell me?

01:06:22.170 --> 01:06:25.170
Nothing. Why don't you see what's going on?

01:06:25.170 --> 01:06:27.350
We're safer here.

01:06:28.350 --> 01:06:30.000
What? But how?

01:06:30.570 --> 01:06:33.070
- With my niece! - With my niece!

01:06:33.170 --> 01:06:36.770
- With the madman! - Don't be afraid, the Lord is coming to avenge you.

01:06:36.870 --> 01:06:39.970
But we've been talking and I've convinced him.

01:06:39.990 --> 01:06:44.240
I just want to tell my cousin that I want him to make my girlfriend very happy.

01:06:44.340 --> 01:06:46.040
I mean, his girlfriend.

01:06:46.070 --> 01:06:47.850
- And the neck? - The lady?

01:06:47.950 --> 01:06:50.850
- My aunt. - Five million more?

01:06:50.930 --> 01:06:53.870
Five million of grace, ma'am.

01:06:53.880 --> 01:06:56.470
- How nice. - It's about to fall, huh?

01:06:56.510 --> 01:07:00.000
- No shame! - Take him! Take him!

01:07:01.790 --> 01:07:04.590
- No! - But what happened, Mr. Judge?

01:07:04.590 --> 01:07:07.430
- This wretch, I don't know how to say it. - Did you miss him?

01:07:07.430 --> 01:07:09.890
- Worse! - Attempted against the authority?

01:07:09.890 --> 01:07:14.430
Not against the authority, precisely, but against the lady of the authority, yes.

01:07:15.570 --> 01:07:17.570
The judge suffers a judicial error.

01:07:17.770 --> 01:07:19.770
What happened is that I stumbled with the lady.

01:07:19.950 --> 01:07:22.850
And in fear that she would be silent, I allowed her to be held.

01:07:23.010 --> 01:07:28.520
That, yes, she is well held, but without the most remote shadow of sin.

01:07:28.520 --> 01:07:30.000
The gentleman is right.

01:07:30.160 --> 01:07:34.520
Well, let's forget this matter. And if you think so, I propose that we all have lunch in the field.

01:07:34.520 --> 01:07:38.690
In the field there is a lot of sun, there is a lot of joy, there is...

01:07:38.690 --> 01:07:40.290
There is little shame.

01:07:40.290 --> 01:07:42.790
I can't go, I can barely walk.

01:07:42.790 --> 01:07:47.150
But there was nothing else missing. You are the first to go, I carry you in my arms.

01:07:47.150 --> 01:07:49.510
Thank you very much, what kindness.

01:07:49.510 --> 01:07:54.630
I carry you in my arms and I let you fall.

01:08:01.180 --> 01:08:21.880
and the problems are over, the life that is good taught me what love is, now I am

01:08:21.880 --> 01:08:30.000
excited, happy and in love, now I have someone to think about

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:31.160
and to think about who you are.

01:08:31.160 --> 01:08:33.970
Long live love!

01:08:33.970 --> 01:08:37.930
That's how it's nice to live!

01:08:37.930 --> 01:08:41.280
My heart always sings to you!

01:08:41.280 --> 01:08:45.870
This old man shamelessly entered the 70s

01:08:45.870 --> 01:08:48.590
and he still feels like a flower!

01:08:48.590 --> 01:08:50.270
And he still feels like a flower!

01:08:50.270 --> 01:08:52.080
No woman, don't be violent,

01:08:52.080 --> 01:08:57.000
because mine is only pure flame and there is no heat!

01:08:57.000 --> 01:09:00.000
And there is no heat, and there is no heat, and there is no heat, and there is no heat!

01:09:00.030 --> 01:09:10.320
forever, my heart!

01:09:10.320 --> 01:09:15.070
Let me get a little closer, I love you, my love.

01:09:15.070 --> 01:09:17.490
Oh, how beautiful is love!

01:09:17.490 --> 01:09:19.330
Oh, how beautiful is love!

01:09:19.330 --> 01:09:23.740
Tighten me, my love, so that with another push

01:09:23.740 --> 01:09:25.880
my situation will be fixed.

01:09:25.880 --> 01:09:29.020
Your situation, your situation, your situation, your situation!

01:09:29.020 --> 01:09:30.000
Viva!

01:09:37.260 --> 01:09:48.180
forever heart
